Z||000000||Gerald||10-15-2001||01:05 PM||||OK so I finaly got my fiero back on the road but Im noticing that it seams hard to start. Even when its warm. Also I can feel it hesitate often in any gear, any speed. I changed the plugs and wires. Do I need new coils? I priced them out and its gonna cost me 100 bucks for the pair but i wanted the opinion of all you wonderful helpful people  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> thanx<P>------------------<BR>87 coupe 5 spd||||reg||1
Z||000001||Voytek||10-15-2001||03:02 PM||||New coils?  Are you going to lower it?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>It could be a few things.  Ok, so you've got new plugs and wires.  I would also suggest changing the distributor cap - cheap to buy and can really improve the way your car runs.  Mine gets this white residue on the contacts inside every so often.  Scrubbing it always helps, but you can only do that so much before you need a new cap.<P>If this doesn't help, I've been told in the past that the O2 sensor can contribute to rough starts/ poor performance/ hesitation.<P>Other than that, I'm out of ideas.  Oh, mine is an '87 GT.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/voyteks_sig2.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Gerald||10-15-2001||06:41 PM||||My car doesent have a distributor. Its a 87 2.5 with DIS. I forgot to mention that every now and then  the engine light comes on. Usualy when the car is warm at idel.<p>[This message has been edited by Gerald (edited 10-15-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000003||Fierowrecker||10-15-2001||08:02 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Gerald:<BR><B>My car doesent have a distributor. Its a 87 2.5 with DIS. I forgot to mention that every now and then  the engine light comes on. Usualy when the car is warm at idel.<P>[This message has been edited by Gerald (edited 10-15-2001).]</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I think Voytec was pullin yer leg...<BR>You need to check the engine codes...<BR>Then you might know where to look...<BR>crash...<BR><P>------------------<BR>crash... The Fierowrecker<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://fiero.nl/uploads/crash_sig.jpg">        <IMG SRC="http://fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif"> ||||reg||1
